<div class="task-intro"><div><span class="eyebrow">Help and next steps</span><p>Short answers to the most common Hub questions.</p></div></div><details class="guidance-detail"><summary>Where are templates and slides?</summary><div><p>Start with <a href="$link.page('CRH', 'Templates & Assets')" class="">Templates and assets</a>. The source pages show file availability. Presentation releases belong in the Hub.</p></div></details><details class="guidance-detail"><summary>Where are photos and video?</summary><div><p>Use <a href="https://skao.canto.global/v/SKAOLibrary?from_main_library" class="">the Canto library ↗</a> and check each asset’s credit and permitted use.</p></div></details><details class="guidance-detail"><summary>Can I adapt material myself?</summary><div><p>Follow the release’s usage notes and keep credits. Ask the relevant content owner about changes to facts or meaning; ask Creative Production about substantial design work.</p></div></details><details class="guidance-detail"><summary>Who approves the work?</summary><div><p>Identify the appropriate content owner and final reviewer in the brief. The approval route depends on the work and should be confirmed rather than assumed.</p></div></details><details class="guidance-detail"><summary>Can I get an urgent turnaround?</summary><div><p>Explain the use date and any flexibility. <a href="$link.page('CRH', 'Turnaround Times')" class="">Scope and timing need agreement</a>.</p></div></details><aside class="next-step"><div><h2>Still stuck?</h2><p>Include the relevant page or asset link.</p></div><a href="https://jira.skatelescope.org/servicedesk/customer/portal/364" class="text-link">Ask for help ↗</a></aside><nav class="section-next" aria-label="More in Get help"><div class="section-next-head"><h2>More in Get help</h2><a class="related-all" href="$link.page('CRH', 'How To Work With Us')">Work with Creative Production →</a></div><div class="related-grid"><a class="related-card" href="$link.page('CRH', 'How To Submit Your Deck')"><span class="related-next">Next</span><strong>Share material</strong><span>Choose what you are sharing. Submission starts a review; it does not publish or approve a file.</span></a><a class="related-card" href="$link.page("CRH", "What's New")"><strong>Hub updates</strong><span>Use the resource pages for current files and availability. Older announcements are not evidence that a release is ready.</span></a><a class="related-card" href="$link.page('CRH', 'Archive')"><strong>Updates archive</strong><span>No verified release history is presented in this review build.</span></a></div></nav>
