<div class="task-intro"><div><span class="eyebrow">Self-service guide</span><p>Confirm the organiser’s dimensions and output requirements before choosing a layout.</p></div><a href="$link.page('CRH', 'Poster Templates')" class="button">Check poster templates</a></div><div class="checklist-bar" data-checklist="making-a-poster.html"><span class="checklist-progress" role="status" aria-live="polite">0 of 6 done</span><span class="checklist-meter" aria-hidden="true"><i></i></span><button type="button" data-checklist-reset>Clear ticks</button><button type="button" data-print>Print</button></div><section class="reading-section checklist"><h2>Prepare the content</h2><ul class="check-list"><li><label><input type="checkbox"><span>Decide the main message, title, authors and the information the audience needs.</span></label></li><li><label><input type="checkbox"><span>Use readable headings, a clear reading order and enough space around figures.</span></label></li><li><label><input type="checkbox"><span>Keep credits and sources with images and charts.</span></label></li></ul></section><section class="reading-section checklist"><h2>Prepare the output</h2><ul class="check-list"><li><label><input type="checkbox"><span>Confirm print size, orientation and submission format with the organiser or supplier.</span></label></li><li><label><input type="checkbox"><span>Check image resolution at the intended size and proof the exported file.</span></label></li><li><label><input type="checkbox"><span>Confirm colour, bleed and delivery requirements with the supplier.</span></label></li></ul></section><aside class="next-step"><div><h2>Sending it to print?</h2><p>Use the actual supplier requirements.</p></div><a href="$link.page('CRH', 'Preparing Files for Print')" class="text-link">Check print preparation</a></aside><nav class="section-next" aria-label="More in How-to guides"><div class="section-next-head"><h2>More in How-to guides</h2><a class="related-all" href="$link.page('CRH', 'Self-Service Guides')">Self-service guides →</a></div><div class="related-grid"><a class="related-card" href="$link.page('CRH', 'Preparing Files for Print')"><span class="related-next">Next</span><strong>Prepare files for print</strong><span>Use the supplier’s specifications for the actual product. A single export recipe does not fit every print job.</span></a><a class="related-card" href="$link.page('CRH', 'Accessibility Guidelines')"><strong>Accessibility checks</strong><span>Build accessibility into the document or presentation, then check the exported result.</span></a><a class="related-card" href="$link.page('CRH', 'Adobe Firefly')"><strong>Using AI image tools</strong><span>Use the current SKAO AI policy and approved tools before starting a task.</span></a></div></nav>
