ss="related-all" href="$link.page('CRH', 'Self-Service Guides')">Self-service guides →</a></div><div class="related-grid"><a class="related-card" href="$link.page('CRH', 'Accessibility Guidelines')"><span class="related-next">Next</span><strong>Accessibility checks</strong><span>Build accessibility into the document or presentation, then check the exported result.</span></a><a class="related-card" href="$link.page('CRH', 'Adobe Firefly')"><strong>Using AI image tools</strong><span>Use the current SKAO AI policy and approved tools before starting a task.</span></a><a class="related-card" href="$link.page('CRH', 'Making Your Own Poster')"><strong>Prepare a poster</strong><span>Confirm the organiser’s dimensions and output requirements before choosing a layout.</span></a></div></nav>
