<div class="task-intro"><div><span class="eyebrow">Planning the work</span><p>Give the actual use date and explain what depends on it. Delivery timing is agreed after the brief and capacity are reviewed.</p></div><a href="$link.page('CRH', 'Submitting a Request')" class="button">Send the brief</a></div><section class="reading-section"><h2>What affects the schedule</h2><ul><li>When usable content and source files will be ready.</li><li>The output, complexity and amount of adaptation required.</li><li>Who reviews the work and when they can respond.</li><li>Supplier production, delivery and other dependencies.</li></ul></section><aside class="next-step"><div><h2>An urgent request?</h2><p>State the real deadline, its reason and what can be reduced. Urgency does not automatically create a delivery commitment.</p></div><a href="https://jira.skatelescope.org/servicedesk/customer/portal/364" class="text-link">Open the helpdesk ↗</a></aside><nav class="section-next" aria-label="More in Get help"><div class="section-next-head"><h2>More in Get help</h2><a class="related-all" href="$link.page('CRH', 'How To Work With Us')">Work with Creative Production →</a></div><div class="related-grid"><a class="related-card" href="$link.page('CRH', 'Requesting New Video Content')"><span class="related-next">Next</span><strong>Brief video or animation</strong><span>Check existing footage first, then explain what a new piece needs to achieve.</span></a><a class="related-card" href="$link.page('CRH', 'Print Materials')"><strong>Plan print materials</strong><span>Define what needs producing before asking for artwork or a quote.</span></a><a class="related-card" href="$link.page('CRH', 'Print Supplier Contacts')"><strong>Work with print suppliers</strong><span>Confirm the supplier, specification, budget and approvals for the actual job.</span></a></div></nav>
