<div class="task-intro"><div><span class="eyebrow">Concept development</span><p>Use the current SKAO AI policy and approved tools before starting a task.</p></div></div><section class="reading-section"><h2>Before using a tool</h2><ul><li>Check whether the material is suitable for the approved service.</li><li>Use only data permitted by the current SKAO AI policy; do not upload confidential or personal material.</li><li>Verify factual accuracy, rights and suitability before using generated imagery in a deliverable.</li><li>Keep concept imagery clearly distinguished from photography or verified scientific representations.</li></ul></section><aside class="next-step"><div><h2>Need advice on a creative use?</h2><p>Describe the purpose and proposed output without sending unsuitable source material.</p></div><a href="https://jira.skatelescope.org/servicedesk/customer/portal/364" class="text-link">Ask the creative team ↗</a></aside><p class="quiet-note">Tool availability, model versions and credit allocations are not confirmed by this page. Check the current approved service and account.</p><nav class="section-next" aria-label="More in How-to guides"><div class="section-next-head"><h2>More in How-to guides</h2><a class="related-all" href="$link.page('CRH', 'Self-Service Guides')">Self-service guides →</a></div><div class="related-grid"><a class="related-card" href="$link.page('CRH', 'Making Your Own Poster')"><span class="related-next">Next</span><strong>Prepare a poster</strong><span>Confirm the organiser’s dimensions and output requirements before choosing a layout.</span></a><a class="related-card" href="$link.page('CRH', 'Preparing Files for Print')"><strong>Prepare files for print</strong><span>Use the supplier’s specifications for the actual product. A single export recipe does not fit every print job.</span></a><a class="related-card" href="$link.page('CRH', 'Accessibility Guidelines')"><strong>Accessibility checks</strong><span>Build accessibility into the document 