<div class="task-intro"><div><span class="eyebrow">Find and use media</span><p>Canto is the source library for media. The Hub provides guidance and routes to it.</p></div><a href="https://skao.canto.global/v/SKAOLibrary?from_main_library" class="button">Open the Canto library ↗</a></div><section class="reading-section"><h2>Find, check, download</h2><ol><li>Search for a subject, event or location, then narrow the results with available filters.</li><li>Open an asset and read its credits, use restrictions and available download formats.</li><li>Download the appropriate version and keep the source link with your work.</li></ol></section><details class="guidance-detail"><summary>I can’t access or download a file</summary><div><p>Send the library or asset link and the error message through <a href="https://jira.skatelescope.org/servicedesk/customer/portal/364" class="">the creative helpdesk</a>. Do not include passwords. Browsing and download permissions may differ.</p></div></details><details class="guidance-detail"><summary>I want to upload material</summary><div><p>Use the authorised upload route provided for your material. <a href="$link.page('CRH', 'How To Submit Your Deck')" class="">See how to contribute</a>.</p></div></details><aside class="next-step"><div><h2>Looking for presentation slides?</h2><p>Presentation releases belong in the Hub.</p></div><a href="$link.page('CRH', 'Slide Decks & Presentations')" class="text-link">Find presentation resources</a></aside><nav class="section-next" aria-label="More in Photos and video"><div class="section-next-head"><h2>More in Photos and video</h2><a class="related-all" href="$link.page('CRH', 'Photography Media')">Photos and video →</a></div><div class="related-grid"><a class="related-card" href="$link.page('CRH', 'Approved Hero Images')"><span class="related-next">Next</span><strong>Hero images</strong><span>Find a strong image for a cover, banner or presentation.</span></a><a class="related-card" href="$link.page('CRH',